WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From hands and knees, stack the shoulders over the wrists, fingers spread wide.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Step the feet back one at a time into one long line from heels to crown.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Draw the lower belly up and lengthen the tailbone toward the heels.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Press the floor away, broadening across the upper back.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the neck long, gaze just past the fingertips, and hold with steady breath.
